      50.64,
      446.25,
      286.44,
      545.56
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following Land/Servitude which is required for the Construction of Matale New intake and Pump - house of Visal Matale Water Supply Project.",
